      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَقْمَدُ</span></b> , fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَمْدَآءُ</span>, (L, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمُدٌّ</span></b>  and [fem.?
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمُدُّ</span> above] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمُدَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُمُدَّانِيَّةٌ</span>, (K,) <i>Large
